{"version":1,"key":"card:582","content":{"id":582,"content":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是指 Cookie、TLS 客户端证书、保存用户名和密码的认证信息的数据。在使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"fetch","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 请求数据时，可以通过 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 参数控制是否携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 信息，它有三种取值：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8bd9123f-99e5-4d88-a090-c42dcf36be8d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"omit","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：在任何条件下，请求和响应中均不携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"16fc3f3e-abe4-427e-8f2d-54614c362f46","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7446c798-ebbd-4fd9-9e98-bc0644451da8","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"same-origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：默认值，仅在同域请求的情况下携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7817fb25-7b6b-42cd-a9ab-0485cc52861f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"56f09bdb-a2f3-4c72-876e-0d9bdb2848ac","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"include","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：始终携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，即使跨域","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f22ed618-e796-4260-9b1c-261119cb99ef","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"对于跨域请求，如果设置了 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials: include","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，很容易引发 CSRF 攻击，因此还需要服务端设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 响应头，并且 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的值必须明确，即不能使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"*","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 这样的通配符。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"385a53ff-e6b8-4501-8778-02a0bb29ac3d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"对于简单请求，服务端必须设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 响应头，否则浏览器会直接返回网络错误","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"af914db6-7728-4005-a8b8-b47d514732c8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"17fbbf98-a6be-409d-88a5-59d4d04680a0","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"对于非简单请求，会先发送一个","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"不携带","type":"formatted"},{"text":" ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的预检请求，如果服务端没有正确设置 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"Access-Control-Allow-Origin","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 响应头，那么浏览器直接返回网络错误，如果正确设置了，才会发送携带 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"credentials","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的真实请求","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4e0054fb-696e-4ac0-abaf-bc2c674709af","disableDra